CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Average Inventory Value] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE(([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count]))=1,(IIF(ISEMPTY([Measures].[Inventory Value Day Sum]) OR VALIDMEASURE(([Measures].[Internal Simulated Calendar Days]))&lt;=0,NULL,[Measures].[Inventory Value Day Sum]/VALIDMEASURE(([Measures].[Internal Simulated Calendar Days])))),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='SimulationDaily', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='SimulationDaily';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Mean Completed Line Late Days] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE(([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count]))=1,(IIF([Measures].[Completed Line Count]&gt;0,[Measures].[Completion Late Days Sum]/[Measures].[Completed Line Count],NULL)),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Whole Order OTIF] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE(([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count]))=1,(IIF([Measures].[Due Order Count]&gt;0,[Measures].[On Time Full Order Count]/[Measures].[Due Order Count],NULL)),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[ROP Production Requested Qty] AS IIF(NOT ISEMPTY(([Measures].[BaselineActivity Run Min], [Activity].[Activity].&amp;[PRODUCTION_REQUEST])) AND ([Measures].[BaselineActivity Run Min], [Activity].[Activity].&amp;[PRODUCTION_REQUEST])=([Measures].[BaselineActivity Run Max], [Activity].[Activity].&amp;[PRODUCTION_REQUEST]) AND ([Measures].[BaselineActivity Unit Min], [Activity].[Activity].&amp;[PRODUCTION_REQUEST])=([Measures].[BaselineActivity Unit Max], [Activity].[Activity].&amp;[PRODUCTION_REQUEST]),(([Measures].[Raw ROP Activity Qty],[Activity].[Activity].&amp;[PRODUCTION_REQUEST])),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='BaselineActivity', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='BaselineActivity';
