CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[ROP Activity Count] AS IIF(NOT ISEMPTY(([Measures].[BaselineActivity Run Min])) AND ([Measures].[BaselineActivity Run Min])=([Measures].[BaselineActivity Run Max]),([Measures].[Raw ROP Activity Count]),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='BaselineActivity', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='BaselineActivity';
