CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Lost Tranche Count] AS IIF(NOT ISEMPTY(([Measures].[InquiryTranche Run Min])) AND ([Measures].[InquiryTranche Run Min])=([Measures].[InquiryTranche Run Max]),([Measures].[Raw Lost Tranche Count]),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='InquiryTranche', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='InquiryTranche';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Inquiry Unit On Time Rate] AS IIF(NOT ISEMPTY(([Measures].[InquiryLineDelivery Run Min])) AND ([Measures].[InquiryLineDelivery Run Min])=([Measures].[InquiryLineDelivery Run Max]) AND ([Measures].[InquiryLineDelivery Unit Min])=([Measures].[InquiryLineDelivery Unit Max]),(IIF([Measures].[Inquiry Requested Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[Inquiry On Time Qty]/[Measures].[Inquiry Requested Qty],NULL)),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='InquiryLineDelivery', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='InquiryLineDelivery';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Inquiry Tranche OTIF] AS IIF(NOT ISEMPTY(([Measures].[InquiryTranche Run Min])) AND ([Measures].[InquiryTranche Run Min])=([Measures].[InquiryTranche Run Max]),(IIF([Measures].[Inquiry Tranche Count]&gt;0,[Measures].[On Time Tranche Count]/[Measures].[Inquiry Tranche Count],NULL)),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='InquiryTranche', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='InquiryTranche';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Internal KPI Calendar Days] AS VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Simulated Calendar Days]), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0', VISIBLE=0, DISPLAY_FOLDER='RunDay', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='RunDay';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count])=1 AND NOT ISEMPTY(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Min])) AND VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Min])=VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Max]),VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Raw Due Cohort Demand Qty]),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty] AS ([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty],[Product].[Manufactured].&amp;[1]), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort On Time Qty] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count])=1 AND NOT ISEMPTY(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Min])) AND VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Min])=VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Max]),VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Raw Due Cohort On Time Qty]),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Due Cohort On Time Qty] AS ([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort On Time Qty],[Product].[Manufactured].&amp;[1]), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Lost Qty] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count])=1 AND NOT ISEMPTY(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Min])) AND VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Min])=VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Max]),VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Raw Due Cohort Lost Qty]),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Due Cohort Lost Qty] AS ([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Lost Qty],[Product].[Manufactured].&amp;[1]), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Ending Backlog Qty] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count])=1 AND NOT ISEMPTY(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Min])) AND VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Min])=VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Line Unit Key Max]) AND COUNT(TAIL(NONEMPTY(GENERATE(EXISTING [Due Date].[Date].[Date].MEMBERS,{LINKMEMBER([Due Date].[Date].CURRENTMEMBER,[Simulation Date].[Date])}),{[Measures].[Internal KPI Calendar Days]}),1))=1,COALESCEEMPTY(SUM(TAIL(NONEMPTY(GENERATE(EXISTING [Due Date].[Date].[Date].MEMBERS,{LINKMEMBER([Due Date].[Date].CURRENTMEMBER,[Simulation Date].[Date])}),{[Measures].[Internal KPI Calendar Days]}),1),VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Detail Open Customer Line Remaining Qty EOD])),0),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Filled Qty] AS [Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty]-[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Lost Qty]-[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Ending Backlog Qty], FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Late Qty] AS [Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Filled Qty]-[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort On Time Qty], FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Due Cohort Ending Backlog Qty] AS ([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Ending Backlog Qty],[Product].[Manufactured].&amp;[1]), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Due Cohort Filled Qty] AS ([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Filled Qty],[Product].[Manufactured].&amp;[1]), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Due Cohort Late Qty] AS ([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Late Qty],[Product].[Manufactured].&amp;[1]), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[On Time Unit Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[Due Cohort On Time Qty]/[Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU On Time Unit Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort On Time Qty]/[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Due Cohort Fill Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[Due Cohort Filled Qty]/[Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Fill Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Filled Qty]/[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Late Delivery Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[Due Cohort Late Qty]/[Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Late Delivery Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Late Qty]/[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Lost Unit Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[Due Cohort Lost Qty]/[Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Lost Unit Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Lost Qty]/[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[End Backlog Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[Due Cohort Ending Backlog Qty]/[Measures].[Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU End Backlog Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty]&gt;0,[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Ending Backlog Qty]/[Measures].[All SKU Due Cohort Demand Qty],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderLineService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderLineService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Open Due Order Count] AS IIF([Measures].[Due Order Count]&gt;0 AND COUNT(TAIL(NONEMPTY(GENERATE(EXISTING [Due Date].[Date].[Date].MEMBERS,{LINKMEMBER([Due Date].[Date].CURRENTMEMBER,[Simulation Date].[Date])}),{[Measures].[Internal KPI Calendar Days]}),1))=1,COALESCEEMPTY(SUM(TAIL(NONEMPTY(GENERATE(EXISTING [Due Date].[Date].[Date].MEMBERS,{LINKMEMBER([Due Date].[Date].CURRENTMEMBER,[Simulation Date].[Date])}),{[Measures].[Internal KPI Calendar Days]}),1),VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Detail Due Open Customer Orders EOD])),0),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Open Order Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[Due Order Count]&gt;0,[Measures].[Open Due Order Count]/[Measures].[Due Order Count],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Full By End Rate] AS IIF([Measures].[Due Order Count]&gt;0,([Measures].[Due Order Count]-[Measures].[Lost Order Count]-[Measures].[Open Due Order Count])/[Measures].[Due Order Count],NULL), FORMAT_STRING='0.00%', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='OrderService', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='OrderService';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[All SKU Late Unit Days] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count])=1 AND NOT ISEMPTY([Measures].[Daily Unit Key Min]) AND [Measures].[Daily Unit Key Min]=[Measures].[Daily Unit Key Max],SUM(EXISTING [Simulation Date].[Date].[Date].MEMBERS,[Measures].[Backlog Qty EOD]),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='SimulationDaily', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='SimulationDaily';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Late Unit Days] AS ([Measures].[All SKU Late Unit Days],[Product].[Manufactured].&amp;[1]), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='SimulationDaily', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='SimulationDaily';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Average Daily Production Good Qty] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Simulated Calendar Days])&gt;0,[Measures].[Production Good Qty]/VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Simulated Calendar Days]),NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='SimulationDaily', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='SimulationDaily';
CREATE MEMBER CURRENTCUBE.[Measures].[Holding Cost] AS IIF(VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Audit Run Count])=1,[Measures].[Inventory Value Day Sum]*VALIDMEASURE([Measures].[Internal Holding Cost Annual Rate])/365.0,NULL), FORMAT_STRING='#,##0.00', VISIBLE=1, DISPLAY_FOLDER='SimulationDaily', ASSOCIATED_MEASURE_GROUP='SimulationDaily';</Text></Command></Commands></MdxScript>
